# A short Pong session for the replay tests (docs/rv32-window.md): the serve
# goes right, the right paddle moves down to return it, the left player misses
# and the right one scores, the second serve goes left and the left paddle
# returns it, the game is paused and resumed, and Q ends the run at frame 200.
frame 0 down SPACE
frame 0 up SPACE
frame 5 down DOWN
frame 20 up DOWN
frame 120 down SPACE
frame 120 up SPACE
frame 125 down W
frame 134 up W
frame 160 down P
frame 160 up P
frame 170 down P
frame 170 up P
frame 200 down Q
